<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices fall, cattle rises in July.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices fall, cattle rises in July.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement grain, cattle and milk prices fell in July, while pork price rose, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES		 JULY	JUNE    JULY 96</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  49.92     50.81    64.53</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -1.8	-0.7     -0.3</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		   -22.6     -21.5     94.6</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  38.76     40.48    39.63</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -4.2	 0.9	1.0</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    -2.2	 3.2     80.5</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.46	2.44     2.55</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -3.5	-1.9	0.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		     0.8	-3.5     11.8</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.83	3.61     3.11</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    23.4	 0.5     12.7</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		     6.3	30.7     26.8</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.57	0.57     0.50</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -0.6	-1.3     -1.2</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    14.0	13.2     16.4</p>
